.TH "Docv::Roff::Builder" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::Roff::Builder \- Collects formatted output into \fB\%Block\fRs.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv"\fR
.sp
\fBclass Docv::Roff::Builder\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
Collects formatted output into \fB\%Block\fRs. Text goes to the current block,
created on demand from the formatting environment, or to the innermost
capture (tags, headings, table cells).
.SH "CONSTRUCTORS"
.PP
\fBdef self.new(env : Env)\fR
.SH "INSTANCE METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef begin_capture : Nil\fR
Starts capturing text; pair with \fB\%end_capture\fR.
.TP 4
\fBdef blank(lines : Int32, hard : Bool = false) : Nil\fR
Adds \fIlines\fR of vertical space. Soft space merges with adjacent soft
space and is dropped at the start and in no\-space mode.
.PP
\fBdef blocks : Array(Docv::Block)\fR
.TP 4
\fBdef break_line : Nil\fR
Ends the current output line.
.TP 4
\fBdef capture : Array(Span)\fR
Captures the text produced by the block.
.TP 4
\fBdef capturing? : Bool\fR
True when text is being captured instead of set in a block.
.TP 4
\fBdef current : Block\fR
The block receiving text, created from the environment on demand.
.TP 4
\fBdef end_capture : Array(Span)\fR
Ends the innermost capture and returns its spans.
.TP 4
\fBdef env : Env\fR
The formatting environment new blocks take their properties from.
.TP 4
\fBdef env=(env : Env)\fR
The formatting environment new blocks take their properties from.
.TP 4
\fBdef finish : Nil\fR
Finishes output: a pending tag becomes a block of its own.
.TP 4
\fBdef hang(offset : Int32) : Nil\fR
Sets the first\-line offset of the next block (hanging paragraphs).
.TP 4
\fBdef heading(level : Int32, spans : Array(Span), indent : Int32) : Nil\fR
Adds a heading of \fIlevel\fR (1 section, 2 subsection) at \fIindent\fR.
.TP 4
\fBdef no_space=(no_space : Bool)\fR
No\-space mode (\fB\%.ns\fR): soft vertical space is dropped until text.
.TP 4
\fBdef no_space? : Bool\fR
No\-space mode (\fB\%.ns\fR): soft vertical space is dropped until text.
.TP 4
\fBdef no_word_space : Nil\fR
Cancels a pending word space.
.TP 4
\fBdef table(table : Table, indent : Int32) : Nil\fR
Adds a table at \fIindent\fR.
.TP 4
\fBdef tag(spans : Array(Span), indent : Int32) : Nil\fR
Sets the tag of the next block, placed at column \fIindent\fR.
.TP 4
\fBdef text(text : String, style : UInt16) : Nil\fR
Appends \fItext\fR in \fIstyle\fR, preceded by a pending word space.
.TP 4
\fBdef word_space(hard : Bool = false) : Nil\fR
Requests a word space before the next text (end of a filled input
line); a \fIhard\fR space does not break.
.SH "DEFINED IN"
src/docv/roff/builder.cr
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR "Docv::Block" (3cr),
